      "title": "Be There for the Beginning: Celebrate the Launch of NVIDIA RTX Spark",
      "link": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/local-ai-rtx-spark-launch-event-invite/",
      "summary": "A new beginning for Windows PCs starts tomorrow with the launch of NVIDIA RTX Spark — one PC built for creators, gamers and AI agents. All are invited to celebrate with NVIDIA and partners at launch events around the world. Share Your Spark Every PC has a story. What was your first Windows PC, and […]",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T17:00:23+00:00",
